nt","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"TwFOLcctyBEla1eklJs9qQ","review_id":"pEwhWEB7BRySodlwTo_Zrw","date":"2014-06-30T19:16:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9448668956756592,"text_excerpt":"Love this place! Came here to sample some wine after going to brunch down the road. The owner and his son are extremely personable and have a nice selection of local wines as well as other miscellaneous goodies. They don't mind taking the time to stop and educate u on wine. Every Friday they also have a wine tasting with I'm looking forward to checking out. Support this local business!!"},{"business_id":"TwFOLcctyBEla1eklJs9qQ","review_id":"UzHFARDtvG-X9JNBMaAsew","date":"2019-03-28T15:25:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9337636828422546,"text_excerpt":"I just love this place. Every wine sampling I go to I leave with at least a couple of bottles, which means the tastings are effective lol. They have a great selection of wines and a few liquors as well. The owners are super nice and helpful. I learn so much at the tastings on Fridays. Every member of the staff has told me something I didn't know about wine and about the city of New Orleans. Louis, who does the tastings, is like a walking wine encyclopedia. There's always something going on here and always food being served outside. I went last weekend and they are having \"Red Bean Madness\", which is a red bean bracket of local chefs competing to see who makes the best red beans in the are..."},{"business_id":"TwFOLcctyBEla1eklJs9qQ","review_id":"bCamN9b9v6YhyZ18rSriYg","date":"2017-09-04T16:51:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9269841909408569,"text_excerpt":"One of my favorite spots in town. Threw my 25 birthday here, a close friend going away party. Me and me friends would come for wine and work on Wednesday's. Staff is so friendly, wine is well price, you feel like family and the art is amazing!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"TwFOLcctyBEla1eklJs9qQ","photo_id":"QOXeZaSMrwZ5poOdDGWTGQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QOXeZaSMrwZ5poOdDGWTGQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9398700594902039},{"business_id":"TwFOLcctyBEla1eklJs9qQ","photo_id":"k9pO-z2MwLnnP9K67AUExw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/k9pO-z2MwLnnP9K67AUExw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9398700594902039}]},"notebook_case":null}
